# Nirvacore Ecosystem

## Control tower role

**nirva-AI** (this repo) orchestrates all Nirvacore products. It does not replace them — it routes agents, monitors health, and provides unified chat/memory/workflows.

Registry: `shared/ecosystem.ts` → `NIRVA_ECOSYSTEM[]`

